The native extension targets AxiSEMunity/AxiSEM3D commit
bc67bb2d76deb2fb208d14dff7b7b25c57d9f35f. See native/LICENSE.AxiSEM3D.
The data-domain soft-DTW implementation retains its MIT notice in
diffaxisem3d/LICENSE.soft-dtw.

The salt model and its visualizations derive from the SEG/EAGE 3-D Salt model,
copyright 1997 Society of Exploration Geophysicists, under CC BY 4.0.
The velocity volume was filtered and sampled on a 17 × 17 × 9 grid. The initial
model was Gaussian-smoothed on that grid. Both volumes were then interpolated
to the 33 × 33 × 17 inversion grid. See examples/salt/DATA_ATTRIBUTION.txt
and examples/salt/DATA_LICENSE.txt.
